klatt: let plosive bursts (P_AB) sound with no frication (AF)

User-tuned klatt_synth.c: the noise/burst block and the parallel
formants are gated on AF alone, so a plosive burst with no frication
never plays. Gate them on AF or an AB burst instead, and do not kill
the block while a burst is still active. Comment-only removals aside,
that is the whole of this patch.
Applied at build time so CI builds the same file.
